<title>LATVIA: HANSABANK-LATVIJA 7-MO PROFIT 1.02 MLN LATS.</title>
<headline>HANSABANK-LATVIJA 7-MO PROFIT 1.02 MLN LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven months 1997</p>
<p>				 (million lats unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.02</p>
<p> Assets						70.22</p>
<p> Claims on other credit institutions	 21.14</p>
<p> Current accounts				  32.01</p>
<p> Time deposits				     13.98</p>
<p>NOTE - Hansabank-Latvija, part of Estonia's Hansapank group, made a profit in July of 338,142 lats.</p>
<p>It said its seven-month profit beat the planned profit for</p>
<p>the period by 700,000 lats and that the July earnings were the</p>
<p>highest monthly earnings so far this year.</p>
<p>It said the July profit was 200,000 lats higher than June's</p>
<p>earnings.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Lannin, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
